    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BugLab</strong> isn't just another simulation game \u2014 it's a deep laboratory management experience where tiny creatures power big ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts with a single terrarium evolves into a growing production empire. Raise, feed, sell, automate, and process various insect species, each with unique needs and economic value. As you manage the life cycles within your terrariums, you'll need to balance resources and make strategic decisions as your systems expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production goes far beyond insects. Cultivate tomatoes, wheat, and cabbage in farm plots, produce honey through beekeeping systems, and process gathered raw materials into feed using specialized machines. The food chain you build becomes the backbone of your entire ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed with rich mechanics such as automated feeding, feed production, resource conversion, inventory systems, upgradable hives and terrariums, quests, timed machines, and even interactions with the world outside your lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Unlock new systems over time as the game continues to grow.<br>\ud83d\udc1b Each insect species introduces unique challenges and benefits.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Build, manage, and optimize your own production loop.<br>\ud83d\udd04 Regular content updates bring new species, structures, and mechanics to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BugLab</strong> is the playable embodiment of \u201cbuilding a grand system from tiny lifeforms.\u201d Start your own insect-based production journey and take the first step into a one-of-a-kind experience!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BugLab</strong> isn't just another simulation game \u2014 it's a deep laboratory management experience where tiny creatures power big ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts with a single terrarium evolves into a growing production empire. Raise, feed, sell, automate, and process various insect species, each with unique needs and economic value. As you manage the life cycles within your terrariums, you'll need to balance resources and make strategic decisions as your systems expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production goes far beyond insects. Cultivate tomatoes, wheat, and cabbage in farm plots, produce honey through beekeeping systems, and process gathered raw materials into feed using specialized machines. The food chain you build becomes the backbone of your entire ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed with rich mechanics such as automated feeding, feed production, resource conversion, inventory systems, upgradable hives and terrariums, quests, timed machines, and even interactions with the world outside your lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Unlock new systems over time as the game continues to grow.<br>\ud83d\udc1b Each insect species introduces unique challenges and benefits.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Build, manage, and optimize your own production loop.<br>\ud83d\udd04 Regular content updates bring new species, structures, and mechanics to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BugLab</strong> is the playable embodiment of \u201cbuilding a grand system from tiny lifeforms.\u201d Start your own insect-based production journey and take the first step into a one-of-a-kind experience!</p>",
